      "cost": "3",
      "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per hour</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The humanitarian blesses the land and their allies. In a @Template[type:emanation|distance:30], plants grow and become difficult terrain. Additionally, all allies in the emanation gain 20 temporary Hit Points and can ignore the difficult terrain. These effects last for 1 minute.</p>\n<p>Effect: Cleansing Earth</p>",
